Support the MinGW-w64 8 SDK shipped with Ubuntu 22.04.

Supply missing Winsock option constants (values from current ws2ipdef.h).
Qt already disables the D3D12 backend without ID3D12Device2; do not include
its unavailable debug-layer header before checking that condition.

